		{"id":"hq","type":"text","text":"## Shared Directorate positions\n\n- **Director (Training and Enrollment):** Lt Colonel Md Nahiduzzaman\n- **Director (Administration and Accounts):** Abdullah Al Baki (Deputy Secretary)\n- **Deputy Director (Coordination):** Major Mohammad Bin Sahirul Ibne Riaz\n- **Deputy Director (Administration):** Major Ishtiaq Ahmed","x":680,"y":160,"width":460,"height":310,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"army","type":"text","text":"# Army Wing\n\n- **Wing lead**\nDeputy Director (Army): Major S M Aminul Haque\n\n- **Chain:** DG BNCC → DD (Army) → Regiment Commander → battalions / companies / platoons","x":0,"y":600,"width":500,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"air","type":"text","text":"# Air Wing\n\n**Wing lead:** Deputy Director (Air), Squadron Leader Sagar Soikot Pitom\n\n**Chain:** DG BNCC → DD (Air) → Squadron OC → institutional platoons","x":1320,"y":600,"width":500,"height":220,"color":"5"},
