		{"id":"source","type":"text","text":"## Source and verification notes\n\n- [Wikipedia: Bangladesh National Cadet Corps](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangladesh_National_Cadet_Corps) — unit bases, commanders, and proposed formations. Wikipedia is the priority source for this canvas per request.\n- [Official BNCC officers directory](https://bncc.portal.gov.bd/pages/officers) — current directorate roster, which differs from Wikipedia for Deputy Director (Naval). This canvas uses Lt Cdr Faisal Bin Rashid per Wikipedia.\n- [[BNCC draft]] — background.\n\n**Area note:** Wikipedia gives a city/base for units but does not define wider operational boundaries. Cards distinguish the listed base from an unverified area of operations. Proposed units have no commander or operational area listed.","x":1320,"y":15,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"6"}
